{"path":"chrono/c/difftime","title":"std::difftime","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>difftime","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/c/difftime","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Computes difference between two calendar times as std::time_t objects (time_end - time_beg) in seconds. If time_end refers to time point before time_beg then the result is negative.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ctime\">&lt;ctime&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span> difftime<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\"><span class=\"kw1030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_t</span></span></a> time_end, <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\"><span class=\"kw1030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_t</span></span></a> time_beg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Computes difference between two calendar times as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\">std::time_t</a></span> objects (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">time_end <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> time_beg</span></code>) in seconds. If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">time_end</span></code> refers to time point before <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">time_beg</span></code> then the result is negative.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> time_beg, time_end\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> times to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Difference between two times in seconds.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>On POSIX systems, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\">std::time_t</a></span> is measured in seconds, and <code>difftime</code> is equivalent to arithmetic subtraction, but C and C++ allow fractional units for <code>time_t</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ctime&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time_t\"><span class=\"kw1030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time_t</span></span></a> start <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time\"><span class=\"kw1017\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>nullptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">volatile</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> d <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// some time-consuming operation</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">10000</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>p<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> q <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> q <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">100000</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>q<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            d <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> d <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> p <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> d <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> q <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> d<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Wall time passed: \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">difftime</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/c/time\"><span class=\"kw1017\">std::<span class=\"me2\">time</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>nullptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, start<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" s.<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Wall time passed: 9 s.</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>duration</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  a time interval <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/chrono/difftime\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>difftime</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/c","title":"C Date and time utilities"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::difftime","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Computes difference between two calendar times as std::time_t objects (time_end - time_beg) in seconds."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"time_beg, time_end"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Difference between two times in seconds."},{"label":"Notes","note":"On POSIX systems, std::time_t is measured in seconds, and difftime is equivalent to arithmetic subtraction, but C and C++ allow fractional units for time_t."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"duration","note":"a time interval"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":160,"codeBlockCount":2}
